----------- BOUNDARIES -----------
Defined as straight lines between two points (x1,y1) and (x2,y2).
The lines need to be horizontal or vertical.
The points need to be ordered from bottom to top or left to right.

Format: ( x1 y1; x2 y2 ) boundaryName boundaryType 

Types of boundaries:
	> WestBoundary
	> EastBoundary
	> SouthBoundary
	> NorthBoundary
	
Important!! Cant use 'Interior' as a boundary name

----------------------------------

( 0.475 0.175; 0.475 0.475 ) Int1 WestBoundary

( 0.175 0.475; 0.475 0.475 ) Int2 SouthBoundary

( 0.175 0.175; 0.175 0.475 ) Int3 EastBoundary

( 0.175 0.175; 0.475 0.175 ) Int4 NorthBoundary

( 0 0; 0.65 0 ) Ext1 SouthBoundary

( 0 0; 0 0.65 ) Ext2 WestBoundary

( 0.65 0; 0.65 0.65 ) Ext3 EastBoundary

( 0 0.65; 0.65 0.65 ) Ext4 NorthBoundary
